      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Ali Bin Al Hassan, from Ibrahim Bin Abu Bakr Bin Abu Al Sammal Al Asady, from the one who informed him, ",
          "Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> has said: ‘The dying one is higher with (the distribution of his wealth) for as long as there is the soul within him’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "3. Ahmad ibn Muhammad has narrated from Ali ibn al-Hassan from Ibrahim ibn abu Bakr al-Samal al-Asadiy from those who narrated to him who has narrated the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘One who is about to die is more rightful to his assets as long as he is alive.’” "
        ]
      }
